              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya abwira Yesaya ati “Ijambo ry'Uwiteka avuze ni ryiza.” Arongera aravuga ati “Kuko hazaba amahoro n'iby'ukuri nkiriho.”",
          "type": "text",
